"ошибке при создании или редактировании формы."
msgstr ""
"When entering a property name, a dropdown list of attributes from the "
"data type for which the form is being created appears (if there is a "
"partial name match). This helps to understand which names are already "
"taken to avoid errors when creating or editing the form."

